flickos-control (1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: the Settings window (desktop layout and style,
    tiling, keyboard shortcuts, and tiles for the other settings apps).
  * Mouse & Touchpad and Keyboard pages: flickos-control
    get/set/prepare, the settings in ~/.config/flickos/input and
    keyboard (system defaults in /etc/xdg/flickos/input.conf,
    keyboard.conf), applied through flickos-layout's overlay. The system
    keyboard layout through pkexec and /usr/libexec/flickos/control-
    helper.
  * Default Applications, Power & Idle, Date & Time and Login pages:
    xdg-mime and xdg-terminal-exec's list, flickos-control idle
    (swayidle with the chosen times, restarted on a change),
    timedatectl, and control-helper autologin-on/autologin-off (polkit
    actions per verb) for the calling user.
  * About page (FlickOS, Debian and Linux versions, computer, processor,
    memory, graphics, disk, desktop) with Copy System Info (wl-copy) and
    Report a Problem; flickos-control about prints the same, plus the
    FlickOS packages' versions. Tiles and the logo use the first icon
    the theme has.

